{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/a65a56a8e73a5a0034a4e0b1ccbfc5e5.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A delicious and clumsy puzzle-platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cururu is tired of living on insects. With his backpack on and appetite sky-high, he sets out in search of irresistible combos! Burgers, fries, sodas, and much more await in stages full of floating platforms, crazy traps, and enemies hungry for trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can already taste this adventure in two full stages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Green Lettuce Valley</strong> \u2013 a green field filled with creative switches and alternative routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f <strong>Sandwich Dunes</strong> \u2013 a crunchy desert with tricky traps and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning! The full game will bring even more themed worlds, hilarious enemies, and tasty secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/737a2e18cb86c167451c61c4d87e9608.poster.avif?t=1758583070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/737a2e18cb86c167451c61c4d87e9608.webm?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/737a2e18cb86c167451c61c4d87e9608.mp4?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/189d271a06760b452b508b6833b653b8.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Food Frog</strong> is a low\u2011poly puzzle\u2011adventure game with a top\u2011down camera, where you control Cururu, a cute, chubby, bipedal frog wearing a backpack with a discerning palate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of his usual insect diet, he sets out to explore the world for new flavors\u2014juicy snacks like burgers, fries, sodas, and more. To do so, Cururu must traverse imaginative, challenging levels, complete with floating platforms, wacky switches, treacherous traps, and enemies determined to spoil his feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and accessible gameplay, <strong>Fast Food Frog</strong> blends logic and precision. Each level is a puzzle that calls for experimentation, attention, and a dash of improvisation. The colorful minimalist visuals and laid-back soundtrack create a light, fun, and addictive experience for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover alternate routes, collect secret ingredients, and build the perfect combos to unlock new regions and tasty surprises. But be warned: the more Cururu eats\u2026 the harder it gets to stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/9574b392d81540a9eb88f1561a942594.poster.avif?t=1758583070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/9574b392d81540a9eb88f1561a942594.webm?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/9574b392d81540a9eb88f1561a942594.mp4?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/bb68c3c2c9d4f23b50cc0f7c1ea9abc3.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll find in the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Simple controls, guaranteed fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Cururu, use his elastic tongue to interact with the environment, and throw bombs to clear the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Creative puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate switches, manipulate objects, and find unique solutions for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>The happiness combo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a burger, fries, and a soda to unlock the exit and move forward with a full belly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/689a7636c9b7287090cfa00c9ce259a8.poster.avif?t=1758583070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/689a7636c9b7287090cfa00c9ce259a8.webm?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/689a7636c9b7287090cfa00c9ce259a8.mp4?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/db320c8a802ddce4fa4da78077674185.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s coming in the full game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 More stages and themed worlds \u2013 from scorching volcanoes to underwater scenes and even the paradise of combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 New enemies and obstacles \u2013 speedy penguins, rolling tacos, bouncy jellies, and other surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Gastronomic secrets and alternative routes \u2013 unlock extra challenges and explore every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Vibrant low poly visuals full of charm \u2013 with a relaxed soundtrack to complete the immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Food Frog is a light, fun, and addictive experience for all ages. A sample is already on the plate \u2014 now just take the first leap and try it! \ud83d\udc38\ud83c\udf54</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927430?t=1758583070","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/6a5200740a77c96b47084396da744bed5090430d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758583070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/04bebd94f79e297420b362c6c7279645d59c3734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758583070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/04bebd94f79e297420b362c6c7279645d59c3734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758583070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/a65a56a8e73a5a0034a4e0b1ccbfc5e5.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A delicious and clumsy puzzle-platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cururu is tired of living on insects. With his backpack on and appetite sky-high, he sets out in search of irresistible combos! Burgers, fries, sodas, and much more await in stages full of floating platforms, crazy traps, and enemies hungry for trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can already taste this adventure in two full stages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Green Lettuce Valley</strong> \u2013 a green field filled with creative switches and alternative routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f <strong>Sandwich Dunes</strong> \u2013 a crunchy desert with tricky traps and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning! The full game will bring even more themed worlds, hilarious enemies, and tasty secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/737a2e18cb86c167451c61c4d87e9608.poster.avif?t=1758583070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/737a2e18cb86c167451c61c4d87e9608.webm?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/737a2e18cb86c167451c61c4d87e9608.mp4?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/189d271a06760b452b508b6833b653b8.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Food Frog</strong> is a low\u2011poly puzzle\u2011adventure game with a top\u2011down camera, where you control Cururu, a cute, chubby, bipedal frog wearing a backpack with a discerning palate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of his usual insect diet, he sets out to explore the world for new flavors\u2014juicy snacks like burgers, fries, sodas, and more. To do so, Cururu must traverse imaginative, challenging levels, complete with floating platforms, wacky switches, treacherous traps, and enemies determined to spoil his feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and accessible gameplay, <strong>Fast Food Frog</strong> blends logic and precision. Each level is a puzzle that calls for experimentation, attention, and a dash of improvisation. The colorful minimalist visuals and laid-back soundtrack create a light, fun, and addictive experience for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover alternate routes, collect secret ingredients, and build the perfect combos to unlock new regions and tasty surprises. But be warned: the more Cururu eats\u2026 the harder it gets to stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/9574b392d81540a9eb88f1561a942594.poster.avif?t=1758583070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/9574b392d81540a9eb88f1561a942594.webm?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/9574b392d81540a9eb88f1561a942594.mp4?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/bb68c3c2c9d4f23b50cc0f7c1ea9abc3.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll find in the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Simple controls, guaranteed fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Cururu, use his elastic tongue to interact with the environment, and throw bombs to clear the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Creative puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate switches, manipulate objects, and find unique solutions for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>The happiness combo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a burger, fries, and a soda to unlock the exit and move forward with a full belly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/689a7636c9b7287090cfa00c9ce259a8.poster.avif?t=1758583070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/689a7636c9b7287090cfa00c9ce259a8.webm?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/689a7636c9b7287090cfa00c9ce259a8.mp4?t=1758583070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/extras/db320c8a802ddce4fa4da78077674185.avif?t=1758583070\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s coming in the full game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 More stages and themed worlds \u2013 from scorching volcanoes to underwater scenes and even the paradise of combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 New enemies and obstacles \u2013 speedy penguins, rolling tacos, bouncy jellies, and other surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Gastronomic secrets and alternative routes \u2013 unlock extra challenges and explore every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Vibrant low poly visuals full of charm \u2013 with a relaxed soundtrack to complete the immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Food Frog is a light, fun, and addictive experience for all ages. A sample is already on the plate \u2014 now just take the first leap and try it! \ud83d\udc38\ud83c\udf54</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AlbiStudios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3873660","name":"Fast Food Frog"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927430/de9e4e82378c45abc3bc1c418b4283a594dcf91d/header.jpg?t=1758583070","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3927430/1035760443/b85863c2248e18798c31af0f0b1713fa2d7ed64d/1756863886/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758582869","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3927430/1035760443/b85863c2248e18798c31af0f0b1713fa2d7ed64d/1756863886/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758582869","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3927430/1035760443/b85863c2248e18798c31af0f0b1713fa2d7ed64d/1756863886/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758582869","id":257192410,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192410/movie480.mp4?t=1758582869","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192410/movie_max.mp4?t=1758582869"},"name":"Trailer Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192410/abf8f9a54bf641b95dbfb8a697b292c700fd583e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758582869","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192410/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758582869","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192410/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758582869"}}],"name":"Fast Food Frog Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1